  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BodyPartInfo
  partName: Opercle
  description: 'Description: The opercle is a bony plate forming the main gill cover,
    sitting just behind the skull and hinged to open and close over the gill chamber.


    Function:
    Protects the delicate gills and drives water flow across them by opening and
    closing in rhythm with the mouth, allowing the fish to breathe even while stationary.'
  voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cda44e8cb71cda1469e8e4fd5291559f, type: 3}
  linkedPopupModel: {fileID: 0}
