  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BodyPartInfo
  partName: Pelvic Fins
  description: 'Description: The pelvic fins are a paired set of fins located on
    the underside of the body, generally positioned below or slightly behind the
    pectoral fins.


    Function: Help stabilize the fish and control pitch during
    swimming, working alongside the pectoral fins to fine-tune balance and orientation.'
  voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6526e96d46066444e806a912e942949b, type: 3}
  linkedPopupModel: {fileID: 0}
